  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Framingham, MA\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Framingham, MA\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nFramingham, MA\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n781.684.8387\n659 Worcester Road #9\nFramingham, MA 01701\n[email protected]\ninstagram.com/bluepearlframingham\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nSpecialized Cancer Care for Your Pet, Now in Framingham\nMedical Oncology appointments are now available with Rachel Wong, DVM, DACVIM at BluePearl Framingham. Call us to learn more and book your appointment today!\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Framingham.\nWe are located near the Boston-Worcester Turnpike in Framingham, 30 minutes west of downtown Boston. We serve the greater Boston region, including Woburn, Burlington, Lexington, Waltham, Bedford, Lincoln, Weston, Watertown, Auburndale and Newton.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are by appointment.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Framingham.\nOur modern BluePearl pet hospital in Framingham was originally located in Waltham and moved in 2025 to a modern, renovated, high tech facility to better serve you and your pet.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n781.684.8387\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nTestimonials.\n“Dr. Williams was the best! She made me so comfortable throughout the whole process. We can’t thank BluePearl enough for helping our baby!” — Monica\nRead more of\nMonica’s story\n.\n“I cannot say enough wonderful things about BluePearl and recommend it to everyone I meet with a pet. Thank god you were there for me. I will be forever grateful.”\n–Jonathan I.\nCurrent location.\n781.684.8387\n781.890.2871\n659 Worcester Road #9\nFramingham,\nMA                                    01701\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nCharlestown\nBoston, MA\n56 Roland St.\nBoston, MA 02129\n617.284.9777\n18.54 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nParamus, NJ\n545 Route 17 S\nParamus, NJ 07652\n201.527.6699\n165.31 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nQueens\nForest Hills, NY\n107-28 71st Rd.\nForest Hills, NY 11375\n718.263.0099\n165.97 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it 